  "latest_nl_proof": "Let t = nr. By the definition of the floor function, m = \\lfloor t \\rfloor if and only if m is an integer and m \\le t < m+1. Since m = \\lfloor nr \\rfloor = \\lfloor t \\rfloor, it follows immediately that m \\le nr < m+1. This is exactly the desired inequality.",
